# Terraform state and any operator-local variable files. The state holds the
# account's resource ids and belongs in remote state, not in this repository.
# `.terraform.lock.hcl` is deliberately *not* ignored: it pins the provider
# version every platform resolves, so CI and an operator's laptop agree.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
